    <!-- 3. The App Section -->
    <section id="app" class="section-padding">
        <div class="container split-section">
            <div class="text-content">
                <h2 class="text-primary" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">The App</h2>
                <h3 style="font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px;">Structured <br>Preparation</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 1.125rem;">The app is your architect. It takes your overwhelming "final exams" and breaks them down into hyper-specific, manageable 25-minute sprints.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>Digital planning tool for your daily routine</li>
                    <li>Clean interface – less is more. No distractions</li>
                    <li>Synchronizes with the physical cube</li>
                    <li>Visualizes your progress and keeps you motivated</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="image-content">
                <img src="/assets/images/Handys.png" alt="Foocus App Experience" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/500x600?text=App+Graphic'">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. The Cube Section -->
    <section id="cube" class="section-padding">
        <div class="container split-section reverse">
            <div class="text-content">
                <h2 class="text-primary" style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">The Cube</h2>
                <h3 style="font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 24px;">Focused <br>Sessions</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 1.125rem;">Leave your phone in the other room. The Foocus Cube is your analog partner for deep work, completely independent of digital noise.</p>
                <ul class="feature-list">
                    <li>No display, no distractions</li>
                    <li>Immediate haptic feedback confirms your focus</li>
                    <li>No countdown clock – eliminates time anxiety</li>
                    <li>Integrated reward system (ASMR sequence at the end)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="image-content">
                <img src="/assets/images/Animation_1.gif" alt="Foocus Cube Overview" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/500x600?text=Cube+Graphic'">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. System Combination -->
    <section class="section-padding combination-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">Digital planning. <span class="text-primary">Offline focus.</span></h2>
            <p class="lead">By syncing the Cube and App via Bluetooth, your non-digital sessions are automatically logged into your digital planner. You get the peace of mind of a clear structure with the deep focus of an analog tool.</p>
            
            <div class="images-combined">
