            <div class="text-center">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Built for students, <br><span class="text-primary">by students.</span></h2>
                <p class="lead">We struggled with procrastination, attention span, and structuring our learning. We tried every app. But every app is on the phone. We needed something real.</p>
