    <!-- 7. FAQ -->
    <section id="faq" class="section-padding">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            
            <div class="faq-list">
                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How does the Foocus system work in practice?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Study sessions are done with the Cube - screen-free, no phone. Afterwards, sync the Cube with the App to update your study plan. Analog focus. Digital planning. The best of both worlds.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Do I need both the App and the Cube?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>You can use the App without the Cube and the Cube without the App. However, we recommend using both together to get the full Foocus experience.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How did you develop the Cube?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>We are building Foocus completely in public - from hardware prototypes to app development. Follow our journey on <a href="https://teamfoocus.substack.com" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Substack</a> and see how the Cube comes to life.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>When are you launching?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Foocus is coming in 2026. <a href="#signup" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Sign up here</a> to be the first to know and secure an exclusive early-bird discount.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>How much will the Cube cost?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>We are still finalizing production, so we cannot confirm a final price yet. Based on current estimates, we are targeting a range of 45€ - 65€, in line with comparable products on the market.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">
                        <span>Any tips on how to study effectively?</span>
                        <div class="faq-icon"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes - we run a blog series with short, practical insights on learning and focus. Check it out on our <a href="https://teamfoocus.substack.com" target="_blank" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Substack</a>.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

